<title>USA: IMF SDR charge rates in Oct 14 week.</title>
<headline>IMF SDR charge rates in Oct 14 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said that for the week beginning October 14, the rate of interest and charges on the SDR is 3.81 percent, and the rate of remuneration on members' creditor positions is also 3.81 percent. The rate of charge on members' use of fund credit is 4.17 percent for the week.</p>
<p>No U.S.-SDR exchange rate is available today because of the federal holiday in the United States. On Friday, the IMF reported the U.S.-SDR rate at 1.44004.</p>
</text>
